The reference text states only one of the three reasons is a cap.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-054\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"two of the three have nothing to do with how much traffic a caller has sent in the window it is currently in\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states two of the three reasons are unrelated to traffic sent in the current window.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-055\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A credential may be suspended\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states a credential may be suspended.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-056\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a route may be closed for maintenance\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Closed for maintenance carries the same meaning as closed while being repaired.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-057\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text refers to a 5 megabyte limit on request bodies.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-058\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit, in which case it is refused before it has been read at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states an oversized body is refused before it has been read at all.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-059\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Spending its whole budget is the same as burning its whole budget.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-060\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"without ever reaching the service\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the loop never reaches the service, matching the claim that it reaches nothing.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-061\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the log afterwards shows nothing but a long run of refusals and no successes\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the log shows a long run of refusals and no successes.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-062\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"which reads like an outage and isn’t one\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the run of refusals reads like an outage but is not one.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-063\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the wasted budget is the caller’s own\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the wasted budget is the caller's own.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-064\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Getting what it needs without a cap change means it usually does not need a larger cap.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-065\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the cheapest fix available to almost everybody\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text calls moving work to a quieter hour the cheapest fix available.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-066\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the cheapest fix available to almost everybody\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the fix is available to almost everybody.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-067\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A cap can be raised\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states a cap can be raised.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-068\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"but not on the strength of an assertion that the current one is too small\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states a cap is not raised on the strength of an assertion that it is too small.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-069\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Bring a full week of refusal counts\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text asks for a full week of refusal counts.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-070\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the shape of the traffic across the day\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text asks for the shape of the traffic across the day.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-071\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the deadline that traffic is serving\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The deadline the traffic is serving is the same as the deadline it exists to meet.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-072\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Before it looks at the number at all, the platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the team checks whether the load is smooth or bursty before looking at the number.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-073\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states a burst is cheaper to smooth than to serve at its peak.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-074\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states requests reach the platform team through the usual channel.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-075\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"There is no expedited path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states there is no expedited path.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-076\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"they are answered within two working days\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text gives two working days as the answer time, and the following clause says chasing does not shorten it.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-077\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"chasing an answer doesn’t make it take fewer\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states chasing an answer does not make it take fewer days.\"}]}","ttft_ms":4268,"type":"result","duration_ms":19522,"uuid":"a9f5f33a-4d5a-4970-aba0-3ce34330bb2a","ttft_stream_ms":1381,"time_to_request_ms":115,"first_content_frame_ms":1381,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
